{"id":"d1838ae56b7f2fbc","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CConstraints.md","title":"CConstraints","display":"CConstraints","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CConstraints","parameters":["E"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CConstraints"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>E</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CConstraints E)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ Finite E)\n  (forall e (implies (in e E) (exists a (exists b (and (@ Pair a b e) (and (@ MType a) (@ MType b))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ee0b315916cb8bff\" href=\"?note=ee0b315916cb8bff\" title=\"ZFC_Finite\">Finite</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"dfb4f26b2207f720\" href=\"?note=dfb4f26b2207f720\" title=\"ZFC_MType\">MType</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CConstraints E)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Finite","status":"resolved","id":"ee0b315916cb8bff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_MType|MType]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_MType","status":"resolved","id":"dfb4f26b2207f720","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_MType|MType]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Pair","status":"resolved","id":"0a7fe33bb2e95221","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_MType|MType]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":866,"backlinks":[{"id":"76efdf35dc96e34a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_CConstraints|CConstraints]]；[[ZFC_Finite|Finite]]；[[ZFC_MTSubterm|MTSubterm]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_TBase|TBase]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-500","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_CConstraints|CConstraints]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","ee0b315916cb8bff","dfb4f26b2207f720","0a7fe33bb2e95221","593f9bdab4d60707"]}